From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Igor Pecovnik <igor@armbian.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 21:29:13 +0100
Subject: arm: mediatek: add Banana Pi BPI-R4 board target

Add SD and eMMC targets for the BPI-R4. They boot the rootfs on
mmc 0:5 and fall back to bootstd for NVMe and USB. Enable all four
PCIe slots, USB, SPI-NAND, the switch ports, the I2C RTC and EEPROM.
Save the random MAC once, so it stays the same across boots.
Stop autoboot only on Ctrl-C held, so noise on the UART does not stop
the boot.

Signed-off-by: Igor Pecovnik <igor@armbian.com>
---
